## 2. What Data Gets Collected (Silently)

| Category | Examples | Method |
|---|---|---|
| **Device** | Model, OS, IDFA/GAID, screen size | On app launch |
| **Location** | GPS coords, accuracy, timestamp | Background service |
| **Usage** | Screen opens, taps, session length | Event listeners |
| **Network** | Wi-Fi SSID, carrier, IP | Connectivity API |
| **Contacts/Photos** | Metadata (not content) | Permission-gated |
| **Clipboard** | Text on paste | OS hook |
| **Sensor** | Accelerometer, gyroscope | Native bridge |

